    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "La segunda: sacar pronto los caballos y los alfiles de su casilla inicial. Se llama "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "development",
            "text": "desarrollo"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Llévalos hacia el "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "centre",
            "text": "centro"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y procura mover cada pieza una sola vez al principio: así juegan todas. Aquí los dos bandos sacan un caballo y un alfil."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The second: bring the knights and bishops out from their starting squares early. This is called "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "development",
            "text": "development"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Take them towards the "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "centre",
            "text": "centre"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and try to move each piece only once at the start: that way they all join in. Here both sides bring out a knight and a bishop."
          }
        ]
      },
